Unfortunately not! I meant to try this approach when I could get round to it,
but never did. ( I used it to balance some text in columns before \multicol
existed---the first thing I ever did in LaTeX/TeX.)

You see, the appropriate break points for a question have to be determined by
the structure of the question, with appropriate penalties, eg, break before a
part in preference to before a subpart, and *never* before a displayed
equation. So---it gets complicated. But I agree that it can be done.

Mike

